### REST Client Test File for Contact CRUD Operations
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Security: read single / update / delete require id (Long) + userId (UUID)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiAuth = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth
@apiContacts = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contacts

### ============================================
### SETUP: Register User (needed for testing contacts)
### ============================================

### 0. Register User - Success
# @name registerUser
POST {{apiAuth}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "María",
    "lastName": "López",
    "email": "maria.lopez@mail.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "dni": "55667788",
    "phone": "1123456789"
}

### ============================================
### SUCCESS CASES
### ============================================

### 1. Create Contact - Success
# @name createContact
POST {{apiContacts}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Juan Pérez",
    "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
    "phone": "1123456789",
    "userId": "{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}"
}

### 2. Get Contact By Id + UserId - Success
# @name getContactByIdAndUser
GET {{apiContacts}}/{{createContact.response.body.data.id}}/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. List Contacts By User - Success
# @name listContactsByUser
GET {{apiContacts}}/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Update Contact - Success
# @name updateContact
PUT {{apiContacts}}/{{createContact.response.body.data.id}}/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Juan Pérez Actualizado",
    "email": "juan.nuevo@example.com",
    "phone": "1199999999",
    "userId": "{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}"
}

### 5. Delete Contact - Success
# @name deleteContact
DELETE {{apiContacts}}/{{createContact.response.body.data.id}}/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get Deleted Contact - Not Found (404)
# @name getDeletedContact
GET {{apiContacts}}/{{createContact.response.body.data.id}}/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### 7. Create Contact - Missing name (400)
# @name createContactNoName
POST {{apiContacts}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sinnombre@example.com",
    "phone": "1123456789",
    "userId": "{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}"
}

### 8. Create Contact - Invalid email (400)
# @name createContactBadEmail
POST {{apiContacts}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Juan",
    "email": "esto-no-es-un-email",
    "phone": "1123456789",
    "userId": "{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}"
}

### 9. Create Contact - Non-existent userId (404)
# @name createContactBadUser
POST {{apiContacts}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Fantasma",
    "email": "fantasma@example.com",
    "phone": "1123456789",
    "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 10. Create Contact - Duplicate email (409)
# @name createContactDuplicate
POST {{apiContacts}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Otra Persona",
    "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
    "phone": "1188888888",
    "userId": "{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}"
}

### 11. Get Contact - Malformed Id (400)
# @name getContactBadId
GET {{apiContacts}}/esto-no-es-un-numero/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Delete Contact - Non-existent Id (404)
# @name deleteContactBadId
DELETE {{apiContacts}}/999999/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### DOUBLE-FACTOR SECURITY TESTS
### These verify that id + userId must BOTH match.
### ============================================

### 13. Get Contact - Correct id, wrong userId (404)
# @name getContactWrongUser
GET {{apiContacts}}/{{createContact.response.body.data.id}}/user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. Delete Contact - Wrong id, correct userId (404)
# @name deleteContactWrongId
DELETE {{apiContacts}}/999999/user/{{registerUser.response.body.data.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json